WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.149
- Well, I heard that you
were attacked by a bear once-

00:00:02.149 --> 00:00:03.047
- [Neve] Yes, ya.

00:00:03.047 --> 00:00:04.481
- Which I find fascinating.

00:00:04.481 --> 00:00:05.547
(person laughing)

00:00:05.547 --> 00:00:06.380
So you're a survivor.

00:00:06.380 --> 00:00:07.430
Um, so what was that like,

00:00:07.430 --> 00:00:08.263
was it in Canada?

00:00:08.263 --> 00:00:09.096
- It was in Canada,

00:00:09.096 --> 00:00:09.929
but it's not like I was,

00:00:09.929 --> 00:00:11.360
it was not when we were
camping or anything,

00:00:11.360 --> 00:00:13.006
it was actually on a movie, I was-

00:00:13.006 --> 00:00:13.839
- [Kelly] What?

00:00:13.839 --> 00:00:15.780
- Yeah, I was 17 years old,

00:00:15.780 --> 00:00:20.690
and I was, yeah, playing
this role where she's,

00:00:20.690 --> 00:00:22.257
one with the animals, and-

00:00:22.257 --> 00:00:23.900
(people laughing)

00:00:23.900 --> 00:00:24.733
- [Kelly] That's ironic.

00:00:24.733 --> 00:00:26.100
- Yes.

00:00:26.100 --> 00:00:28.940
And there was, there was
a scene where I'm supposed

00:00:28.940 --> 00:00:30.560
to be getting chased by a bear.

00:00:30.560 --> 00:00:33.170
The only animal I'm not
one within the movie.

00:00:33.170 --> 00:00:35.810
And they just, they
brought this bear on set

00:00:35.810 --> 00:00:38.770
and they said, you know,
dip your hand in hot,

00:00:38.770 --> 00:00:42.870
no, they first gave me a big
bottle of Coke to feed it.

00:00:42.870 --> 00:00:43.703
And I thought-

00:00:43.703 --> 00:00:44.536
- Coca-Cola.

00:00:44.536 --> 00:00:45.812
- Yeah. Coca-Cola.

00:00:45.812 --> 00:00:47.400
So now this is like a
bear on a sugar rush.

00:00:47.400 --> 00:00:49.130
And then they said, and I'm 17,

00:00:49.130 --> 00:00:50.080
so I'm really dumb.

00:00:50.080 --> 00:00:51.330
And they give me, they say,

00:00:51.330 --> 00:00:53.320
dip your hand in honey and just run.

00:00:53.320 --> 00:00:54.960
And when you get to the tree over there,

00:00:54.960 --> 00:00:57.840
turn around and stick your
hand out and feed the bear.

00:00:57.840 --> 00:01:00.730
And I, of course wanting to
please everyone was like, okay.

00:01:00.730 --> 00:01:03.710
- And you're thinking obviously
I'm in a safe environment.

00:01:03.710 --> 00:01:05.257
Someone has done this before me.

00:01:05.257 --> 00:01:06.380
- Yeah, yeah, yeah.

00:01:06.380 --> 00:01:10.640
And I dip my hand in honey
and I run to this rock

00:01:10.640 --> 00:01:11.660
or this tree they told me to go to

00:01:11.660 --> 00:01:13.590
and I turn around and I put my hand out

00:01:13.590 --> 00:01:14.850
and the bear's not slowing down

00:01:14.850 --> 00:01:16.300
and he is not coming from my hand.

00:01:16.300 --> 00:01:19.030
And he grabs me by the leg
and he pulls me through

00:01:19.030 --> 00:01:21.980
the forest and my mother
happens to be visiting set.

00:01:21.980 --> 00:01:24.770
So she's screaming, the
whole crew's frozen,

00:01:24.770 --> 00:01:26.460
because no one can
believe what's happening.

00:01:26.460 --> 00:01:27.760
And it's, and all I could do,

00:01:27.760 --> 00:01:30.170
all I could think to
say was he's biting me.

00:01:30.170 --> 00:01:31.003
Like it wasn't obvious.

00:01:31.003 --> 00:01:32.128
(people laughing)

00:01:32.128 --> 00:01:33.982
- Just if it's not clear.

00:01:33.982 --> 00:01:37.051
- Just in case nobody
knows, he's biting me.

00:01:37.051 --> 00:01:38.039
- Oh my God.

00:01:38.039 --> 00:01:39.630
- Pulled me through the
forest and then finally the,

00:01:39.630 --> 00:01:42.210
the bear wrangler starts
just throwing rocks

00:01:42.210 --> 00:01:43.800
at the bear to get it off me,

00:01:43.800 --> 00:01:45.240
and it finally gets pissed off

00:01:45.240 --> 00:01:46.510
and turns around and goes after him.

00:01:46.510 --> 00:01:49.160
And I run a, I go up a rock, um, yeah-

00:01:49.160 --> 00:01:50.250
- Please tell me right after that,

00:01:50.250 --> 00:01:51.380
they were like, okay, well, okay,

00:01:51.380 --> 00:01:53.340
the next take, we wanted,
no I'm just kidding-

00:01:53.340 --> 00:01:54.620
- No, they did, no, they did, they say.

00:01:54.620 --> 00:01:55.880
They were like, we're not doing it again.

00:01:55.880 --> 00:01:58.070
And I was like, again,
this people pleaser.

00:01:58.070 --> 00:01:59.650
I was like, no, that was rehearsal.

00:01:59.650 --> 00:02:00.483
We didn't get it on camera.

00:02:00.483 --> 00:02:01.480
Let's do it.

00:02:01.480 --> 00:02:04.545
- Oh my God, actors are so
different from musicians.

00:02:04.545 --> 00:02:05.378
(person laughing)

00:02:05.378 --> 00:02:07.050
I'm like, I can't express this enough.

00:02:07.050 --> 00:02:07.928
I, I like literally,

00:02:07.928 --> 00:02:10.830
if I was in a music video
and some like that went down,

00:02:10.830 --> 00:02:11.913
I couldn't say that word on daytime.

00:02:11.913 --> 00:02:14.564
I would be like, bye.

00:02:14.564 --> 00:02:15.850
- So would I, now.

00:02:15.850 --> 00:02:17.930
- CGI, get my stunt double in.

00:02:17.930 --> 00:02:18.890
I'm like what.

00:02:18.890 --> 00:02:20.070
Actors, I always find funny.

00:02:20.070 --> 00:02:22.510
You all, these insane
things happen to you all.

00:02:22.510 --> 00:02:23.343
- So silly.

00:02:23.343 --> 00:02:25.490
But we get asked to do
really silly things as well.

00:02:25.490 --> 00:02:26.760
I'm old, I'm older now.

00:02:26.760 --> 00:02:27.800
I'm like, I'm old now actually.

00:02:27.800 --> 00:02:29.570
- Yeah I know, no, I'm
old too, and I'm like,

00:02:29.570 --> 00:02:31.713
I learned that word "no" real well.

00:02:31.713 --> 00:02:32.770
(people laughing)

00:02:32.770 --> 00:02:33.603
- Oh, for sure.

00:02:33.603 --> 00:02:34.587
- Yeah.

00:02:34.587 --> 00:02:35.640
- For sure. Like, no, absolutely not.

00:02:35.640 --> 00:02:37.190
- Oh, that's crazy.

00:02:37.190 --> 00:02:38.023
- Yeah, yeah.

00:02:38.023 --> 00:02:39.987
- And your mom that nightmare from hell.

00:02:39.987 --> 00:02:41.553
- Oh yeah it was bad.

